title: "ActionShap: Beyond Deletion Faithfulness toward Intervention-Robust Recommendation Explanations"
type: software
abstract: >-
  ActionShap is an evaluation protocol for measuring whether explanations for
  history-conditioned recommenders predict bounded, inference-time profile
  interventions.
